{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p004","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":19,"text":"২. $A_1 \\cap A_2$ এর সমান নিচের কোনটি?\n ক) $A_1$ খ) $A_2$ গ) $A_3$ ঘ) $A_4$","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
