{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p007","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":19,"text":"৫. দেওয়া আছে $U = \\{x : 1 \\le x \\le 20, x \\in Z\\}$, $A = \\{x : x বিজোড় সংখ্যা\\}$ এবং $B = \\{x : x মৌলিক সংখ্যা\\}$। নিম্নের সেটগুলো তালিকা পদ্ধতিতে লিপিবদ্ধ করো:\n ক) $A$ খ) $B$\n গ) $C = \\{x : x \\in A এবং x \\in B\\}$ ঘ) $D = \\{x : x \\in A অথবা x \\in B\\}$","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p008","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":19,"text":"৬. ভেনচিয়ে $A$ ও $B$ সেটের উপাদানগুলোর সংখ্যা দেখানো হয়েছে। যদি $n(A) = n(B)$ হয়, তবে নির্ণয় করো ক) $x$ এর মান খ) $n(A \\cup B)$ গ) $n(B \\setminus A)$।","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p010","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":19,"text":"৭. যদি $U = \\{x : x ধনাত্মক পূর্ণসংখ্যা\\}$, $A = \\{x : x \\ge 5\\} \\subset U$ এবং $B = \\{x : 5x < 12\\} \\subset U$ তবে $n(A \\cap B)$ এবং $n(A' \\cup B)$ এর মান নির্ণয় করো।","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p011","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":19,"text":"৮. যদি $U = \\{x : x জোড় পূর্ণসংখ্যা\\}$, $A = \\{x : 3x \\ge 25\\} \\subset U$ এবং $B = \\{x : 5x < 12\\} \\subset U$ হয়, তাহলে $n(A \\cap B)$ এবং $n(A' \\cap B')$ এর মান নির্ণয় করো।","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p012","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":20,"text":"৯. দেখাও যে, ক) $A \\setminus A = \\varnothing$ খ) $A \\setminus (A \\setminus A) = A$।","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p013","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":20,"text":"১০. দেখাও যে, $A \\times (B \\cup C) = (A \\times B) \\cup (A \\times C)$।","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.ex-p014","chapter":1,"chapterTitle":"সেট ও ফাংশন","topic":"1.ex","topicTitle":"অনুশীলনী ১.১","section":null,"kind":"exercise","page":20,"text":"১১. যদি $A \\subset B$ এবং $C \\subset D$ হয়, তবে দেখাও যে, $(A \\times C) \\subset (B \\times D)$।","verified":false,"reviewReasons":["verify-formula"]}
